OL,3,GNEWSA'How AI helped me remember my
OL,4,Agrandad'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA film of a pilot officer who died
OL,7,Fduring the Second World War has been
OL,8,Fmade by his grandson using artificial
OL,9,Fintelligence.
OL,11,FAnthony Jeaffreson Southwell died, aged
OL,12,F25, in 1942, after failing to return
OL,13,Fhome from a mission over Danish waters.
OL,15,FUsing historical family documents, Nick
OL,16,FSouthwell from Langport in Somerset has
OL,17,Fput together the "emotional" piece
OL,18,Fusing historical documents, which
OL,19,Frecreates the ill-fated mission.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
