OL,5,
OL,6,F"To have a personal connection like
OL,7,Fthat and know what he went through...
OL,8,Fjust makes me incredibly proud of him,"
OL,9,Fsaid Nick, who only knows his
OL,10,Fgrandfather through historical
OL,11,Fdocuments.
